kargul/status/2109370272017207487", "id": "2109370272017207487", "text": "ok when is linkedin getting a redesign?", "raw_text": {"text": "ok when is linkedin getting a redesign? https://t.co/y3AnXxZeve", "display_text_range": [0, 39], "facets": [{"type": "media", "indices": [40, 63], "id": "2109370264928628736", "display": "pic.x.com/y3AnXxZeve", "original": "https://t.co/y3AnXxZeve", "replacement": "https://x.com/marcelkargul/status/2109370272017207487/photo/1"}]}, "author": {"screen_name": "marcelkargul", "url": "https://x.com/marcelkargul", "id": "1566851334283870210", "followers": 60769, "following": 1197, "likes": 33949, "media_count": 3615, "statuses": 27824, "name": "Marcel", "description": "Founder @kargulstudio / A design and engineering partner for scale-ups and enterprise products.", "raw_description": {"text": "Founder @kargulstudio / A design and engineering partner for scale-ups and enterprise products.", "facets": []}, "location": "", "banner_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/1566851334283870210/1786803935", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2097100069376028672/trgGfghP_200x200.jpg", "joined": "Mon Sep 05 18:11:41 +0000 2022", "protected": false, "website": {"url": "http://kargul.studio", "display_url": "kargul.studio"}, "verification": {"verified": true, "verified_at": null, "type": "individual"}, "type": "profile"}, "replies": 34, "reposts": 1, "likes": 170, "bookmarks": 47, "quotes": 7, "embed_card": "summary_large_image", "created_at": "Sun Oct 11 19:47:17 +0000 2026", "created_timestamp": 1791748037, "possibly_sensitive": false, "views": 45586, "is_note_tweet": false, "community_note": null, "lang": "en", "replying_to": null, "media": {"all": [{"type": "photo", "id": "2109370264928628736", "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HUX9FHzXsAA5ZqA.jpg?name=orig", "width": 2048, "height": 1457}], "photos": [{"type": "photo", "id": "2109370264928628736", "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HUX9FHzXsAA5ZqA.jpg?name=orig", "width": 2048, "height": 1457}]}, "provider": "twitter", "reposted_by": null}, {"type": "status", "url": "https://x.com/marcelkargul/status/2109273659038650501", "id": "2109273659038650501", "text": "Lots of people in the comments keep saying to never use big negative letter spacing. I disagree. This is what I use with Geist:\n\n16px \u2192 0%\n36px \u2192 -3%\n100px+ \u2192 -5 to -6%\n\nThe \u201cnever go negative\u201d rule is for body text. At 100px+ the default spacing looks loose, because the gaps between letters scale up with the size. Tightening them is what makes big headlines look clean.\n\nBody text stays at 0%. The bigger the text, the tighter it gets. Nothing goes past -6%, because past that the letters start touching.", "raw_text": {"text": "Lots of people in the comments keep saying to never use big negative letter spacing. I disagree. This is what I use with Geist:\n\n16px \u2192 0%\n36px \u2192 -3%\n100px+ \u2192 -5 to -6%\n\nThe \u201cnever go negative\u201d rule is for body text. At 100px+ the default spacing looks loose, because the gaps between letters scale up with the size. Tightening them is what makes big headlines look clean.\n\nBody text stays at 0%. The bigger the text, the tighter it gets. Nothing goes past -6%, because past that the letters start touching.", "display_text_range": [0, 507], "facets": [{"type": "media", "indices": [277, 300], "id": "2109273052039008256", "display": "pic.x.com/hyDfpzkuQF", "original": "https://t.co/hyDfpzkuQF", "replacement": "https://x.com/marcelkargul/status/2109273659038650501/photo/1"}]}, "author": {"screen_name": "marcelkargul", "url": "https://x.com/marcelkargul", "id": "1566851334283870210", "followers": 60769, "following": 1197, "likes": 33949, "media_count": 3615, "statuses": 27824, "name": "Marcel", "description": "Founder @kargulstudio / A design and engineering partner for scale-ups and enterprise products.", "raw_description": {"text": "Founder @kargulstudio / A design and engineering partner for sc